seg-5e222f965192 = The <c1/> scenario kind analyses low Earth orbit (LEO) positioning, navigation and timing (PNT) signals. It is not tied to one system. A signal is a parameterised design (data, not code), so the same kind analyses a published commercial signal, a representative design for a band nobody has published, or any design a scenario writes inline. The <c2/> kind draws those designs too, in any band from ultra high frequency (UHF) to C, each band with its own jammers, and a <c3/> band or a <c4/> run can carry any of them (see <a1>Where the designs are used</a1>).

